1
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:10,105
You have to think about what
you're putting behind your strikes.

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,777
That's what's gonna tip
things in your favor.

3
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,140
What do you mean? It's like,

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,260
for Volo,

5
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,997
it's the pride and
responsibility that comes with

6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:22,697
being from a family that
teaches swordsmanship.

7
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:27,620
For Golgorosso, it's the confidence
he's got from having muscles of steel.

8
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:32,560
And for Lina, it's the pride she
takes in her polished skills.

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,785
That's the reason why their attacks
are as powerful as they are.

10
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,877
Then what do you think I
should put behind my sword?

11
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:43,372
That's something you're gonna
have to figure out yourself.

12
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:46,100
I'm not a noble or swordsman.

13
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:51,180
All I have are my years spent
in a forest wielding an axe.

14
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:55,100
That and the Aincrad
style Kirito taught me.

15
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,560
Wait, I have something else.

16
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,520
the dark and the dark.

17
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,157
The first thing that you
could see is the only one.

18
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,777
You can't even use it.

19
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:39,331
I won't be able to do it.

20
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:46,530
I'm ready.

21
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,077
I'm ready. I'm ready.

22
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:52,990
I'm ready to continue.

23
00:01:53,073 --> 00:01:54,620
I'm ready. I'm ready to go.

24
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:56,370
I'm ready.

25
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,190
I'm ready to go.

26
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,457
Shining sun, my diamond?

27
00:02:06,540 --> 00:02:08,800
It's a dream of a dream!

28
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:52,180
It seems Disciple Eugeo
prefers hacking away at logs,

29
00:02:52,420 --> 00:02:54,157
rather than working on his form.

30
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:59,380
I recall once hearing Sir Eugeo used to
be a woodcutter in some backwoods hovel.

31
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:03,717
Perhaps the extent of his knowledge is
limited to methods of attacking lumber.

32
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,340
How truly unfortunate.

33
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:10,464
If that is indeed the case, then as someone
who happens to train in the same dorm,

34
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:15,369
perhaps I should graciously lend a hand
and instruct him on proper technique.

35
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:19,034
My, what a considerate thing
of you to offer, Lord Rios.

36
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:21,280
You truly are an exemplary noble.

37
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,940
What say you to that, Sir Eugeo?

38
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:27,837
Will you accept Lord Raios'
generosity and have him train you?

39
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,155
It's a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

40
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,620
I appreciate the offer.

41
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:39,093
Some upperclassmen use their
status as a source of power.

42
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:43,180
Is that why first-seat Raios and
second-seat Umber are so strong?

43
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,753
It's a little different with those guys.

44
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:48,194
Their egos are on a whole nother level.

45
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:49,891
Why do you think that is?

46
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:51,697
Because they're a couple of jerks.

47
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:55,817
Hell, they've been looking down their noses
at people since the day they were born.

48
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,737
They sure don't think much of us.

49
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:59,957
For one, we're from outside the capital.

50
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:02,805
Plus, we don't have any
kind of noble heritage.

51
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:05,317
This might be a good opportunity for me to

52
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:08,100
find out just what their
egos are capable of.

53
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,278
Forgive me for misspeaking just now.

54
00:04:11,420 --> 00:04:13,832
I would happily accept a lesson from you.

55
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,200
Oh, he can't be serious. I am.

56
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:18,780
In fact,

57
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:22,077
I would like my lesson in
the form of a match with you,

58
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,748
Sir Oombear, if that
isn't too much trouble.

59
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,197
Why, you rotten...

60
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:33,760
May I remind you that Lord Oombear is
no slouch when it comes to swordplay.

61
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,680
He may end up striking you.

62
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:38,437
I would prefer if he
stopped just short of that.

63
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:41,020
But if he hits me, then I must accept it.

64
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:44,700
This lesson is for my benefit, after all.

65
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:46,980
Very well.

66
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:51,860
I will be more than happy to demonstrate
my skills for you, Sir Eugeo.

67
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,200
Let us begin, then.

68
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:59,760
Prepare to bear witness to the
essence of the High Norkian Style!

69
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,020
Lightning Slash!

70
00:05:01,260 --> 00:05:03,380
The Norkian Style's secret move!

71
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,610
En Kirito!

72
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,050
Huh.

73
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:23,620
If it's a case of who's stronger, I am!

74
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:30,040
Don't get cocky, you commoner!

75
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:31,860
His power surged.

76
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:34,840
Is that what his arrogance is capable of?

77
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:39,680
Your sword style is a good match
for you, primitive and unsightly.

78
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:44,420
Let's see how you fare
after I crush your shoulder.

79
00:05:45,380 --> 00:05:47,140
I have to switch skills.

80
00:05:58,540 --> 00:05:59,560
That is enough.

81
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,780
I declare this match a draw.

82
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:07,906
But, Lord Raios, I can't walk
away from this rogue with a draw.

83
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,580
I must finish this.

84
00:06:12,340 --> 00:06:13,620
Stand down, Umber.

85
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,174
For what it's worth, Disciple Yu-Gi-Oh,

86
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:27,966
your outlandish moves
were quite entertaining.

87
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,180
After graduating,

88
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:33,776
perhaps you should consider seeking
a calling with the Imperial Circus.

89
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:37,560
Thank you for the
suggestion, Disciple Raios.

90
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:44,197
In due time, I will give you my own
demonstration of a nobleman's power.

91
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,880
I'm free now, if you are.

92
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:52,580
There is more to battle than waving
a sword around, you nameless buffoon.

93
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,800
It's been three days.

94
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:06,197
They should have tried
getting back at me by now.

95
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:08,200
I wonder why they haven't.

96
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,146
They'd be breaking the rules.

97
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:16,460
The schools and the taboo indexes.

98
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:19,331
Those don't make it easy to harass people.

99
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:24,260
On the other hand, anything that doesn't
fall under the rules is up for debate.

100
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:26,637
They could be looking for a loophole.

101
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:28,500
You think they go that far?

102
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:30,460
Just to spite me?

103
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:31,900
I don't know.

104
00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:34,597
Maybe they're not planning
on doing anything.

105
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:37,680
It's possible they're just
trying to psych you out.

106
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,397
Whatever you do, don't let it get to you.

107
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,537
No matter what, you gotta stay cool.

108
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:43,637
What did you say?

109
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:45,180
Stay what now?

110
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:49,276
Oh, uh, that's the secret
mantra of the Aincrad style.

111
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:52,200
It's pretty much the
same as saying stay calm.

112
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:55,266
You can also use it to
say goodbye to someone.

113
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:58,066
It's like another way
of saying see you later.

114
00:07:58,700 --> 00:07:59,617
Oh, okay.

115
00:07:59,700 --> 00:08:02,120
I'll remember that. Stay cool.

116
00:08:02,380 --> 00:08:05,260
What an unusual thing to say. Stay cool?

117
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:06,670
Bizarre.

118
00:08:06,753 --> 00:08:08,636
All right, I'm gonna go hit the sack.

119
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:13,637
Oh, hey, by the way, about tomorrow?

120
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:16,057
I have to run some
errands so you're on here.

121
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:17,140
I know you don't.

122
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:20,597
We promised Tiese and Ronier
we'd take them out for a picnic.

123
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,957
And by we, I mean us.

124
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:25,275
So if you think you can get
out of it, you're mistaken.

125
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,560
They'll be here at 9 sharp.

126
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,257
So make sure you're
ready to leave by then.

127
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:30,170
You got it?

128
00:08:30,253 --> 00:08:31,120
Okay, okay.

129
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,857
Do me a favor, though,
and wake me up at 8.

130
00:08:33,940 --> 00:08:35,877
I need to catch up on some sleep.

131
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,820
No, 8 o 'clock's way too late.

132
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,380
Make it 7.30.

133
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,277
And stay cool.

134
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:44,780
I know I told you that
phrase is like saying bye,

135
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:47,877
but it's not something you
say to someone going to bed.

136
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,790
Why not?

137
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,380
Because you don't.

138
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:53,817
You use it when you're really
saying goodbye to someone.

139
00:08:53,900 --> 00:08:56,820
Oh, what a complicated phrase.

140
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:07,937
If what Kirito said is true,

141
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:13,637
are Umber and Raios capable of
sidestepping the laws of the Axiom Church?

142
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,997
What am I saying?

143
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:21,280
You can't even doubt the Taboo
Index much less disobey it?

144
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:25,940
If there were a way around it,
I could have done something,

145
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:29,440
instead of stand there and
watch Alice get taken away.

146
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:33,660
Why couldn't I disobey
when I had the chance?

147
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:41,770
Alice.

148
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,000
Eugeo, are you listening?

149
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,190
Yujiyo?

150
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,670
Huh?

151
00:09:53,753 --> 00:09:55,580
Sorry, I missed that last part.

152
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,801
You were saying?

153
00:09:57,300 --> 00:09:58,937
You didn't hear a single word.

154
00:09:59,020 --> 00:10:00,137
I'm sorry, I just...

155
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:03,102
I was just admiring how
beautiful the forest was.

156
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,555
It has animals I've never seen before.

157
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,830
Really?

158
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:09,040
Yeah, like that one.

159
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,430
Oh, that?

160
00:10:10,513 --> 00:10:12,857
That's just a plain old golden flying fox.

161
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:14,797
Don't tell me you've never seen one.

162
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,717
They're in every tree in the capital.

163
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,780
Oh, right.

164
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:21,197
I guess you'd be used to them since
you were born and raised here.

165
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:22,110
That's true.

166
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:23,737
Do your folks live nearby?

167
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:25,520
No, they live in District 8.

168
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:28,457
It's a bit of a ways away
from where we are in 5.

169
00:10:28,540 --> 00:10:29,640
Oh, you don't say.

170
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:32,930
Hang on.

171
00:10:33,060 --> 00:10:36,880
If I'm not mistaken, don't you
come from a family of nobles?

172
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:40,694
I thought all of the mansions
were in Districts 3 and 4.

173
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:45,057
Only nobles who are fourth-ranked or
higher get to live in that district.

174
00:10:45,140 --> 00:10:49,700
My father is a sixth-ranked nobleman,
therefore he has no judicial authority.

175
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,660
I didn't know that.

176
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:54,057
I thought that was
something every noble has.

177
00:10:54,140 --> 00:10:54,970
Certainly not!

178
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:58,517
Only nobles fourth rank or
higher are granted that power,

179
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,937
whereas nobles who are
ranked fifth and lower must

180
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:03,617
adhere to the judgment of
those of higher ranking.

181
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:04,780
Oh, interesting.

182
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:11,214
Anyway, that's why someone like myself,

183
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:15,260
an heir to a sixth rank house,
is an aristocrat in name only.

184
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:20,160
In that sense, our lifestyle is really
no different from most people's.

185
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,480
Oh, really?

186
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:23,230
Okay,

187
00:11:23,313 --> 00:11:24,897
so if your opponent
wants to get the drop on

188
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:27,357
you from above with a
high Norkian-style attack,

189
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:31,357
there's two types of strikes you've got
to be ready to defend yourself against.

190
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:35,200
They are a strike from above
or diagonally to the right.

191
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:39,197
If they do anything else, that means
they're going to switch up their footing,

192
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:41,515
so you'll still have time to block it.

193
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:46,220
Man, I'm stuffed.

194
00:11:49,620 --> 00:11:52,180
Um, if it would be alright with you two?

195
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:55,428
We'd like to get your
thoughts on something.

196
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:59,040
It's about Frenika, our
roommate at the dormitory.

197
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:03,537
The elite disciple whom
she unfortunately is

198
00:12:03,620 --> 00:12:06,620
forced to serve under is
a rather crude individual.

199
00:12:07,060 --> 00:12:08,737
Well, over the past few days,

200
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:12,408
he's been giving her orders that
go way beyond inappropriate.

201
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:14,420
His ranking is no excuse.

202
00:12:14,900 --> 00:12:19,517
If he's making her do things that violate
the school's rules, he should be reported.

203
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,680
That's just it.

204
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:23,377
Technically, they're not violations,

205
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:27,700
but the demands he makes of a
female student are so obscene.

206
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,625
You don't have to say anymore.

207
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,340
The problem is,

208
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:36,197
the only way to change for Nika's mentor
is to get the approval of her current one.

209
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,751
Can you tell us his name?

210
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:41,250
Yes.

211
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:44,920
It's second-seat elite
disciple, Umber Zizek.

212
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,620
I'm not surprised.

213
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:52,920
A few days ago, I had a sparring
match with Umber in the training hall.

214
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,640
We ended it in a draw.

215
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:57,920
In fact, he seemed pretty upset by that.

216
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:02,400
My guess is he's taking his
frustrations out on Franika.

217
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,437
He's doing this out of revenge?

218
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,700
How could he be so cruel?

219
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:09,860
I just can't understand it.

220
00:13:10,780 --> 00:13:13,839
We live in a larger house
than most other civilians.

221
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:19,297
And enjoy some additional privileges,
But my father would always remind me?

222
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:22,197
that we should never take
those things for granted.

223
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:26,339
He'd say we were obliged to ensure
everyone, no matter their station,

224
00:13:26,540 --> 00:13:28,716
could live a happy and peaceful life.

225
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,320
And if war broke out,

226
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:34,880
it's our duty to take up our
swords first and protect the weak.

227
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,577
And yet, because of the heartless orders!

228
00:13:37,660 --> 00:13:39,320
That were issued by a noble,

229
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:42,937
Frenika couldn't help but cry
herself to sleep last night.

230
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:44,140
It's not right.

231
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:47,160
How can something like this be allowed?

232
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:50,640
Thank you.

233
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:55,777
There's a phrase in the Sacred
Tongue that comes to mind,

234
00:13:55,860 --> 00:13:58,620
which, let's see, it's pronounced?

235
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,140
noblesse oblige, I think.

236
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:02,970
Basically,

237
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:08,540
it means whoever's got the power should
use it for the sake of the vulnerable.

238
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:12,240
Just like your father
said, it's a code of honor.

239
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:17,560
And that kind of honor is more
important than any law or custom.

240
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:23,100
There are things you just shouldn't do,
even if there's no law against them.

241
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:24,920
At the same time,

242
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:29,500
there might be stuff you should do,
even if the laws say you shouldn't.

243
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:34,800
I think I understand
what it is you're saying.

244
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:40,000
If I'm hearing you correctly, the
Taboo Index doesn't cover everything.

245
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,920
In cases like this one,

246
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:46,640
we have to use our own personal sense
of what's right and what's wrong.

247
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:48,702
Instead of blindly obeying laws,

248
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:52,760
we need to ask why they exist
and if they're even honorable.

249
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:57,160
That self-reflection is more
important than just blind faith.

250
00:14:57,580 --> 00:14:59,400
Yep, that's exactly right.

251
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:03,517
It's super important to learn how
to act and think for yourself.

252
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:06,837
That's worth more than the best
sword or the flashiest move.

253
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:10,038
Even though Umber didn't
technically break the rules,

254
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,800
what he did is still 100 % wrong.

255
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:16,217
Someone's got to hold
him accountable for that.

256
00:15:16,300 --> 00:15:19,580
In this case, it looks
like it's up to us, too.

257
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,110
Right.

258
00:15:21,340 --> 00:15:23,020
We'll go and sort this out.

259
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,600
Well, well.

260
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:31,360
To what do we owe the pleasure
of this visit, Disciple Eugeo?

261
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,900
And on the evening of
our day of rest, no less.

262
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:37,335
I've come to report a troubling rumor.

263
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:41,420
Unfortunately, it concerns Disciple Zizek.

264
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:46,541
I thought I'd bring this to your attention
before it damaged his stellar reputation.

265
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,960
Are you mocking me?

266
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,500
Oh, my.

267
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:51,720
I must say, I'm surprised.

268
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:54,097
I wouldn't have expected this from you.

269
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:58,651
How thoughtful of you to be concerned
for the sake of my friend's good name.

270
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:03,460
However, I'm afraid I have no idea
what this rumor you speak of could be.

271
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:10,097
Along with the nature of these claims,

272
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:12,877
I must ask where you
acquired this information.

273
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:16,666
From Lord Zizek's page, along
with the girls who room with her.

274
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,979
As far as the claims are concerned,

275
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:23,300
they say Lord Zizek has been
issuing perverse orders to his page.

276
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:27,020
Franika, what are these perverse orders?

277
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:30,772
I'm not following what it is
you're getting at, Sir Eugeo.

278
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:34,580
Which of the school's regulations
has he violated specifically?

279
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,730
Sir,

280
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:41,877
even if something isn't
specifically forbidden here,

281
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,297
do you not agree there are
things an elite disciple

282
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:47,086
should never do as a
primary trainee's mentor?

283
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:50,077
Oh, I can tell this upsets you.

284
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:55,120
Now then, what exactly are you
insinuating Umber forced Fronica to do?

285
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,520
I couldn't say.

286
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,500
Well, what say you, Umber?

287
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:03,605
Do you have any idea what it is
Sir Eugeo could be referring to?

288
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,140
Not even the foggiest!

289
00:17:07,360 --> 00:17:10,580
Try as I might, I can't
make heads nor tails of it.

290
00:17:10,840 --> 00:17:14,720
It is true that I asked her to
perform some menial tasks for me.

291
00:17:14,860 --> 00:17:19,017
But ever since my duel with Sir Eugeo,
which regrettably ended in a draw,

292
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:22,577
I'm a changed man and have
immersed myself fully in

293
00:17:22,660 --> 00:17:26,057
my training why I've been
using muscles I did not know

294
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:30,657
I had and as a result my
body ached so badly in such

295
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:33,697
a humbled state as I was
in I had no choice but to

296
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:37,657
ask her to massage me every
night while I bathed I was

297
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:40,757
concerned she would soil
her uniform so I graciously

298
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:43,637
had her stripped down and
massage me in her undergarments

299
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:46,517
honestly I can't for the
life of me understand?

300
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:49,200
how anyone could think that perverse.

301
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:54,480
Because of your behavior,

302
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:57,237
Frenika has been beside herself.

303
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:59,180
If you continue harassing her,

304
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:01,717
I will be forced to bring
it to the attention?

305
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,918
of our instructors.

306
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,360
I hope you understand. Why you!

307
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:12,980
I appreciate the warning, Disciple Eugeo.

308
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,620
Do whatever you feel is right.

309
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,021
Don't let those jerks get to you.

310
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,500
I don't know how you kept so calm.

311
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:26,171
I thought I was going to lose it in there.

312
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:29,200
Lucky for them, you didn't
have your sword. Well,

313
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:33,817
at least now I'm pretty sure they're up
to something more than just being creeps.

314
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:34,730
What?

315
00:18:34,813 --> 00:18:36,677
I get the feeling the reason they're going

316
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:39,377
to all this trouble is
to set a trap for you.

317
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:40,477
Really? Yeah.

318
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:44,640
Look, if you'd taken their bait
and started going off on Humber,

319
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:48,277
they could have accused you of
being disrespectful to them,

320
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,637
and they'd be in their
rights to punish you.

321
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:51,550
You see?

322
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:56,610
Don't worry.

323
00:18:56,693 --> 00:18:59,875
If Humber doesn't stop messing
with Fronica, he'll pay.

324
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:02,608
For now, all we can do
is tell the teachers.

325
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:04,935
So stay sharp and keep your eyes open.

326
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,860
All right, I'll do that.

327
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:11,997
And you, Gio, if those guys say
anything to you when I'm not around,

328
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,097
try not to get yourself all
riled up like you did back there.

329
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,560
I won't, I promise.

330
00:19:16,940 --> 00:19:19,080
I'll just, you know, stay cool.

331
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:20,970
Exactly.

332
00:19:21,053 --> 00:19:22,500
Stay cool. Always.

333
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,180
Allow me to make my report.

334
00:19:27,820 --> 00:19:29,160
All chores are done.

335
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:31,957
The assigned cleaning
has also been completed.

336
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:33,800
Good work, as usual.

337
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:35,477
I really appreciate it.

338
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:37,913
Oh, it's nothing on your page after all!

339
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:42,720
By the way, if you have the time, I'd
like to talk to you about something.

340
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,860
You don't have to stand.

341
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,120
Please, sit down.

342
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:55,980
Very well, if you insist.

343
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,740
It's about Frenika.

344
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,668
I had a talk with Umber
about her yesterday.

345
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:13,762
Did you really?

346
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:16,480
I doubt he wants to get into any trouble,

347
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:20,840
so I'm pretty sure he won't be
harassing her anymore. Thank goodness.

348
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:25,166
You don't know how grateful I
am, Elite Disciple Yu-Gi-Oh, sir.

349
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:29,069
Your work's done for today, so
please just call me Yu-Gi-Oh.

350
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,821
Anyway, there's something
I need to apologize for.

351
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:37,640
I wasn't sure of it
yesterday, but now I am.

352
00:20:38,240 --> 00:20:40,497
The reason this happened
in the first place

353
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:43,720
was all because of the
duel I had with Umber.

354
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:47,900
Do you think you could set
up a meeting with her for me?

355
00:20:48,300 --> 00:20:50,420
I'd like to apologize in person.

356
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:55,700
Yes, of course.

357
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:59,997
Honestly, despite what you say,
none of this is really your fault.

358
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:04,139
But I'll be more than happy to convey
your wishes to her nonetheless.

359
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:07,817
Um, could I...

360
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:10,500
Could I sit closer to you?

361
00:21:12,760 --> 00:21:14,060
Uh, sure.

362
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:25,920
I've been thinking, after I
graduate from the academy,

363
00:21:26,820 --> 00:21:29,526
I'll take over as head
of the Streenan family.

364
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:31,350
As is custom,

365
00:21:31,433 --> 00:21:35,889
I will then have to marry a noble who
is of the same rank or possibly higher.

366
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,980
And it terrifies me!

367
00:21:41,940 --> 00:21:46,620
What if the man who becomes my husband
turns out to be someone like Lord Zizek?

368
00:21:47,460 --> 00:21:50,377
Someone who is cruel to
others and who lacks the basic

369
00:21:50,460 --> 00:21:53,401
principles of honor my
father raised me to uphold.

370
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:54,840
I'm so scared.

371
00:21:55,860 --> 00:21:56,880
What do I do?

372
00:22:07,500 --> 00:22:08,330
Tiese.

373
00:22:08,413 --> 00:22:13,500
Yujiyo, if it would be alright, I'd
like to ask another favor of you.

374
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:18,080
I have no doubt that eventually
you'll rise to the top of our class,

375
00:22:18,300 --> 00:22:20,077
win the swordsmanship tournament,

376
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:23,336
and compete in the Fort
Empire Unification Tournament.

377
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:24,640
I hope to.

378
00:22:24,900 --> 00:22:27,917
I mean, I am working
hard toward that goal.

379
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:30,940
And then, after that,

380
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:36,220
if you, if you rank high in
the Unification Tournament,

381
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:38,940
I heard you can be appointed as a noble.

382
00:22:39,280 --> 00:22:41,557
That's what happened
with our supervisor, Ms.

383
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:42,470
Asurika.

384
00:22:43,440 --> 00:22:49,260
And then, if you do decide to take a
title, do you think, would you be my...

385
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:55,042
I'm not here for the tournament.

386
00:22:56,340 --> 00:22:59,869
I'm doing this to become an
Integrity Knight and find Alice.

387
00:23:00,380 --> 00:23:02,000
But I can't tell her that.

388
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:07,900
It's okay.

389
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:11,362
After the tournament,
we'll talk more about this.

390
00:23:12,700 --> 00:23:13,800
I'll be waiting.

391
00:23:14,580 --> 00:23:16,420
And I'll work as hard as you.

392
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:18,837
I want to become strong enough.

393
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,560
So that I can speak up for what is right.

394
00:23:23,080 --> 00:23:24,617
Just like you, Yujiya.

395
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:27,560
They are least to you.
